This directory vendors a subset of KataGo's Python code, used by the
feature-embedding pipeline (pipeline/extract_activations.py and friends)
to load b18c384nbt model weights into PyTorch and run forward passes
with hooks on residual-block outputs.

Upstream:      https://github.com/lightvector/KataGo
Pinned commit: 92ad583d4852ebaacd5f0398f052bdb537affe19
Vendored on:   2026-05-08

What was copied: the entire katago/ Python subpackage (game/, train/,
utils/) plus KataGo's top-level LICENSE. Some files in train/ and game/
are training-pipeline-only and unused by inference; they are kept to
avoid breaking intra-package imports and may be pruned later.

License: see LICENSE in this directory (KataGo's terms).
Modifications to vendored files: none.
